+   contradicts the filing intent.
+2. **Zero information loss.** GitHub retains closed issues read-only with full bodies;
+   this report re-records the decisive tables on main where the landing commit message
+   links both numbers. The evidence chain survives closure intact.
+3. **The zero-duplicate doctrine cuts toward closure.** Two never-claimed, no-work
+   P3s re-triaged hourly by every solver are pure federation tax — the same argument
+   that closed #1897/#1933 (PR #1982) and that the board's own
